{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"0t0c1d2e3f4a5b6c","type":"group","x":200,"y":1680,"width":1280,"height":520,"color":"3","label":"🎯 The 5-Stage Journey: From Latent Dragon to Soaring"},
		{"id":"2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c","type":"group","x":-450,"y":200,"width":380,"height":1360,"color":"1","label":"❌ The 99% Problem: Wrong Effort"},
		{"id":"8h8c9d0e1f2a3b4c","type":"group","x":100,"y":200,"width":380,"height":1360,"color":"4","label":"✓ The 1% Solution: Right Direction"},
		{"id":"4n4c5d6e7f8a9b0c","type":"group","x":650,"y":200,"width":380,"height":1360,"color":"5","label":"🐉 潛龍心法: The 4 Principles"},
		{"id":"7aa7d8e9f0a1b2c3","type":"group","x":355,"y":2360,"width":970,"height":200,"color":"2","label":"⚡ Key Techniques & Mindsets"},
		{"id":"3c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d","type":"text","text":"### 1. 方向錯誤 (Wrong Direction)\n\n• Hard work ≠ Success\n• Effort without strategy\n• Brute force approach","x":-430,"y":298,"width":340,"height":194},
		{"id":"4d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e","type":"text","text":"### 2. 缺乏系統 (No System)\n\n• Random trial & error\n• No clear methodology\n• Reactive, not proactive","x":-430,"y":570,"width":340,"height":194},
		{"id":"5e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f","type":"text","text":"### 3. 懷才不遇 (Unrealized Potential)\n\n• Talent remains hidden\n• Effort invisible to others\n• No breakthrough achieved","x":-430,"y":842,"width":340,"height":194},
		{"id":"6f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a","type":"text","text":"### 4. 時機不對 (Wrong Timing)\n\n• Acting without preparation\n• Not aligned with cycles\n• Missing natural windows","x":-430,"y":1114,"width":340,"height":194},
		{"id":"7g7b8c9d0e1f2a3b","type":"text","text":"**Result:** Stuck in the \"卦象\" (wrong destiny pattern)","x":-430,"y":1386,"width":340,"height":116},
		{"id":"0j0e1f2a3b4c5d6e","type":"text","text":"### 2. 潛龍心法 (Latent Dragon Method)\n\n• Hidden technique of masters\n• Strategic patience\n• Building power silently","x":120,"y":570,"width":340,"height":230},
		{"id":"1k1f2a3b4c5d6e7f","type":"text","text":"### 3. 時機把握 (Seize the Moment)\n\n• Wait for the right time\n• Recognize opportunities\n• Strike when ready","x":120,"y":842,"width":340,"height":218},
		{"id":"2l2a3b4c5d6e7f8a","type":"text","text":"### 4. 卦象轉換 (Transform Your Pattern)\n\n• Change destiny (卦象)\n• From hidden to visible\n• From preparation to action","x":120,"y":1114,"width":340,"height":246},
		{"id":"3m3b4c5d6e7f8a9b","type":"text","text":"**Result:** Escape 未遇, achieve visibility & success","x":120,"y":1386,"width":340,"height":116},
		{"id":"5o5d6e7f8a9b0c1d","type":"text","text":"### 潛龍之心 (Latent Heart)\n\n• Know what you're building\n• Have a clear vision\n• Patient development\n• Hidden strength","x":670,"y":298,"width":340,"height":222},
		{"id":"6p6e7f8a9b0c1d2e","type":"text","text":"### 無為之心 (Non-Action Heart)\n\n• Work without forcing\n• Align with natural laws\n• Let things flow naturally\n• No struggle","x":670,"y":570,"width":340,"height":230},
		{"id":"7q7f8a9b0c1d2e3f","type":"text","text":"### 時機之心 (Timing Heart)\n\n• Understand cycles\n• Know when to wait\n• Know when to act\n• Respect natural rhythms","x":670,"y":842,"width":340,"height":218},
		{"id":"8r8a9b0c1d2e3f4a","type":"text","text":"### 蛻變之心 (Transformation Heart)\n\n• Prepare for change\n• Build capacity gradually\n• Ready to emerge at right time\n• Complete metamorphosis","x":670,"y":1114,"width":340,"height":246},
		{"id":"9s9b0c1d2e3f4a5b","type":"text","text":"**Combined:** The complete mastery mindset","x":670,"y":1386,"width":340,"height":116},
		{"id":"1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b","type":"text","text":"# 易經 × 潛龍心法\n## The I Ching's Hidden Success Blueprint\n\n**99% Wrong Effort → 1% Right Direction**\n\nEscape mediocrity through ancient wisdom, not just hard work","x":-10,"y":-280,"width":600,"height":280,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"1u1d2e3f4a5b6c7d","type":"text","text":"**Stage 1:**\n\n潛龍勿用\n(Latent Dragon)\n\nBuilding in shadows","x":243,"y":1720,"width":227,"height":194},
		{"id":"2v2e3f4a5b6c7d8e","type":"text","text":"**Stage 2:**\n\n見龍在田\n(Dragon Appears)\n\nFirst visibility","x":481,"y":1720,"width":227,"height":194},
		{"id":"3w3f4a5b6c7d8e9f","type":"text","text":"**Stage 3:**\n\n飛龍在天\n(Flying Dragon)\n\nFull manifestation","x":720,"y":1720,"width":227,"height":194},
		{"id":"4x4a5b6c7d8e9f0a","type":"text","text":"**Stage 4:**\n\n亢龍有悔\n(Overreach)\n\nKnow the limit","x":958,"y":1720,"width":227,"height":194},
		{"id":"5y5b6c7d8e9f0a1b","type":"text","text":"**Stage 5:**\n\n龍戰于野\n(Dragon Conflict)\n\nMastery achieved","x":1196,"y":1720,"width":227,"height":194},
		{"id":"6z6c7d8e9f0a1b2c","type":"text","text":"### Critical Understanding:\n\nMost people try to skip Stage 1-2, forcing action too early (卦象錯誤). Success requires patience through the latent stage, building strength invisibly until natural emergence happens.","x":460,"y":1960,"width":700,"height":193},
		{"id":"8ab8e9f0a1b2c3d4","type":"text","text":"### 戰略層面\n(Strategic Level)\n\n• Understand your 卦象\n• Know your position\n• Choose right battles\n• Avoid forced moves","x":415,"y":2400,"width":270,"height":120},
		{"id":"9ac9f0a1b2c3d4e5","type":"text","text":"### 心態層面\n(Mindset Level)\n\n• Patience is power\n• No ego, no rush\n• Trust the process\n• Believe in timing","x":709,"y":2400,"width":270,"height":120},
		{"id":"0ad0a1b2c3d4e5f6","type":"text","text":"### 行動層面\n(Action Level)\n\n• Build skills daily\n• Prepare constantly\n• Stay invisible until ready\n• Emerge decisively","x":1003,"y":2400,"width":270,"height":120},
		{"id":"1ae1b2c3d4e5f6a7","type":"text","text":"## 🔑 The Core Truth\n\n**你的努力不是錯的，方向錯了。你的潛能不是沒有，只是時機未到。**\n\n*Your effort isn't wrong—your direction is. Your potential isn't absent—your timing just isn't right.*\n\n**The Latent Dragon Method teaches you to align BOTH correctly.**","x":415,"y":2680,"width":858,"height":280},
		{"id":"9i9d0e1f2a3b4c5d","type":"text","text":"### 1. 正確方向 (Right Direction)\n\n• Align with natural flow\n• Know your position\n• Follow the pattern","x":120,"y":298,"width":340,"height":222}
	],
